> FOSDEM will be held the 1st and 2nd of February 2014 in Brussels,
> Belgium.
> 
> It would be nice if people proposed some Buildroot related talks. This
> year, there are slots of 20 minutes or 60 minutes, so people can also
> propose "short" topics, such as an experience feedback in using
> Buildroot for a real product, or talking about new Buildroot features,
> etc.

Submissions require a small abstract and short speaker presentation
and should be submitted to fosdem.embedded at gmail.com or through
https://penta.fosdem.org/submission/ before the 10th of December 2013.
You can apply for a full length (~45 min) or a shorter (~20min) talk.

See https://lists.fosdem.org/pipermail/fosdem/2013-October/001870.html
for details.

